SUMMARY:Matthew Hayhow: Bring Out The Gimp
LOCATION:The Parliament Arms\, 67 Canongate\, Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Disabled people are often seen as brave\, inspirational role mo
 dels. Matthew Hayhow is on a one-man mission to put a stop to that. Matthew
  may use a power chair\, but what he lacks in basic motor function he more 
 than makes up for in his comedic skills. Bring Out The Gimp is the debut ho
 ur from a comedian who delights in finding humour in any topic\, no matter 
 how uncomfortable\, and delivering it in his trademark deadpan demeanour.\n
 More info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/matthew-hayhow-bring-
 out-the-gimp/
